OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACoroner raises concerns about 999
OL,4,Aresponse to trapped mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a prevention of future deaths
OL,7,Freport, Suffolk Coroner Darren Stewart
OL,8,Fsaid "there was a possibility of
OL,9,Fsuccessful resuscitation" had the
OL,10,Ffirefighters who freed her been sent
OL,11,Fearlier by the ambulance service
OL,12,Fcontrol room.
OL,14,FThe East of England Ambulance Service
OL,15,FTrust (EEAST), which handled the
OL,16,Femergency call, said changes had been
OL,17,Fmade to procedures and training.
